{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "PACS - Post Apocalypse Courier Service: Co-op Delivery Simulator",
    "steam_appid": 3079190,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive, repair, upgrade and customize your trucks to navigate desolate wastelands and deserted cities, alone or with friends. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to grow your Post Apocalypse Courier Service (P.A.C.S.) from a small-time garage operation to national mega corp., and become the best in the wasteland?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>MudRunner</i> meets <i>Euro Truck Simulator 2</i> meets <i>Mad Max</i> reimagined as a post apocalyptic delivery driving simulator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver parcels alone or with friends to take P.A.C.S. from small-time garage operation to national mega corp.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive through extreme conditions and navigate treacherous terrain</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge for parts and repair your vehicles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize and upgrade your vehicles including suspension, gearbox, engine, fuel tank and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sort parcels, manage your inventory and strategically utilize vehicle capacity</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079190/extras/c241d8da1afa57e57c3b808d153dbb9e.poster.avif?t=1736538124\" width=616 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079190/extras/c241d8da1afa57e57c3b808d153dbb9e.webm?t=1736538124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079190/extras/c241d8da1afa57e57c3b808d153dbb9e.mp4?t=1736538124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a desolate but beautifully diverse wasteland, from treacherously icy peaks to sandy dunes and grimy, muddy, flooded swamps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079190/extras/2aa59711ad6683e4b5de845a73724a90.poster.avif?t=1736538124\" width=616 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079190/extras/2aa59711ad6683e4b5de845a73724a90.webm?t=1736538124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079190/extras/2aa59711ad6683e4b5de845a73724a90.mp4?t=1736538124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye out for parts to scavenge \u2013 you never know when you may find a spare tire or truck part left behind by those less fortunate. Get your hands dirty with repairs, and upgrade your truck\u2019s suspension, gearbox, engine, fuel tank and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079190/extras/615c6355fe60d8407005f38140f88db9.poster.avif?t=1736538124\" width=616 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079190/extras/615c6355fe60d8407005f38140f88db9.webm?t=1736538124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079190/extras/615c6355fe60d8407005f38140f88db9.mp4?t=1736538124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your inventory as you sort and pack parcels. Utilize your vehicle\u2019s capacity and carefully consider which parcels to deliver along your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While going it alone is a completely valid option, Post Apocalypse Delivery Simulator: Multiplayer Courier Delivery supports co-op multiplayer for up to four players. Play your way and head out with friends for a relaxing, slow-paced drive or squad up with teammates to take on serious delivery jobs together.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive, repair, upgrade and customize your trucks to navigate desolate wastelands and deserted cities, alone or with friends. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to grow your Post Apocalypse Courier Service (P.A.C.S.) from a small-time garage operation to national mega corp., and become the best in the wasteland?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>MudRunner</i> meets <i>Euro Truck Simulator 2</i> meets <i>Mad Max</i> reimagined as a post apocalyptic delivery driving simulator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver parcels alone or with friends to take P.A.C.S. from small-time garage operation to national mega corp.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive through extreme conditions and navigate treacherous terrain</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge for parts and repair your vehicles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize and upgrade your vehicles including suspension, gearbox, engine, fuel tank and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sort parcels, manage your inventory and strategically utilize vehicle capacity</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079190/extras/c241d8da1afa57e57c3b808d153dbb9e.poster.avif?t=1736538124\" width=616 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079190/extras/c241d8da1afa57e57c3b808d153dbb9e.webm?t=1736538124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079190/extras/c241d8da1afa57e57c3b808d153dbb9e.mp4?t=1736538124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a desolate but beautifully diverse wasteland, from treacherously icy peaks to sandy dunes and grimy, muddy, flooded swamps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079190/extras/2aa59711ad6683e4b5de845a73724a90.poster.avif?t=1736538124\" width=616 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079190/extras/2aa59711ad6683e4b5de845a73724a90.webm?t=1736538124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079190/extras/2aa59711ad6683e4b5de845a73724a90.mp4?t=1736538124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye out for parts to scavenge \u2013 you never know when you may find a spare tire or truck part left behind by those less fortunate. Get your hands dirty with repairs, and upgrade your truck\u2019s suspension, gearbox, engine, fuel tank and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079190/extras/615c6355fe60d8407005f38140f88db9.poster.avif?t=1736538124\" width=616 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079190/extras/615c6355fe60d8407005f38140f88db9.webm?t=1736538124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079190/extras/615c6355fe60d8407005f38140f88db9.mp4?t=1736538124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your inventory as you sort and pack parcels. Utilize your vehicle\u2019s capacity and carefully consider which parcels to deliver along your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While going it alone is a completely valid option, Post Apocalypse Delivery Simulator: Multiplayer Courier Delivery supports co-op multiplayer for up to four players. Play your way and head out with friends for a relaxing, slow-paced drive or squad up with teammates to take on serious delivery jobs together.</p>",
    "short_description": "Can you build delivery vehicles to survive the post apocalypse? Go it alone or with up to 4 friends as you navigate treacherous environments, make deliveries, customise vehicles, scavenge for parts, and grow your delivery business! Get ready for a thrilling off-road experience - wishlist now!",
